# This folder holds the revision batch's outputs: the analysis behind the manuscript's two
# revision sections on the constructed nulls and on the width dependence of the sample floor.
#
# The JSON summaries and NUMBERS.md ship, because those are what the manuscript quotes and
# what NUMBERS.md indexes.  The fitted weight matrices and the resume checkpoints do not:
# scripts/revision/ regenerates every one of them deterministically from the seeds NUMBERS.md
# records, e.g.
#   REV_DIR=_rev python scripts/revision/_rev_night.py randompanel
*_W.npz
*.npz
*.ckpt.json
